description:
This spell allows a priest to summon a single greater elemental from his sphere of major access. Determine the Hit Dice of the elemental with percentile dice:
01-65,10HD;
66-90,14HD;
91-00,18HD. 
Greater elementals are described in the Monstrous Compendium, DARKSUN Appendix, Terrors of the Desert. 

This spell is otherwise identical to the fifth-level priest spell conjure elemental.
